### 创建项目 (vue3 模板)
POST {{base_url}}/api/project/create-project
Content-Type: application/json

{"projectId": "{{test_project}}", "templateType": "vue3"}

### 创建项目 (react 模板)
POST {{base_url}}/api/project/create-project
Content-Type: application/json

{"projectId": "test-react-001", "templateType": "react"}

### 获取项目文件树
GET {{base_url}}/api/project/get-project-content?projectId={{test_project}}

### 获取项目文件内容 (单个文件)
GET {{base_url}}/api/project/get-project-content?projectId={{test_project}}&path=package.json

### 删除项目
GET {{base_url}}/api/project/delete-project?projectId={{test_project}}

### 上传单个文件 (multipart)
POST {{base_url}}/api/project/upload-attachment-file?projectId={{test_project}}&filePath=uploaded.txt
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

hello world
------boundary--
